-- ---------------------------------------------------------------- 4. Synthetic synesthesia as interface reshaping
-- Training a cross-modal binding (e.g. literacy or morphological-color synesthesia) reshapes a
-- nervous system's active sensory interface from S-raw (mode false) to S-syn (mode true) mid-run.
SynesthesiaDS : Sig → Sig → DynSig
SynesthesiaDS S-raw S-syn = GatedDS S-raw S-syn
